The feed top's geometry was only ever checked by eye, so a 41px chip or a
4px drift in the banner gap shipped unnoticed. The suite now asserts the
seven equal chips, the 44px hit bands, the header's calendar/refresh pair
and the 8px rhythm at both viewports in both languages, and prints every
measured number. The banner check measures the pill's hit band instead of
its 36px box, which is no longer the target size.

